 x 18 1/2 inches. The Menil Collection. The Menil Collection, Houston, Bequest of Janie C. Lee. © Georgia O'Keeffe Museum","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"provenance_narrative","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/local/provenance_narrative"}],"content":"Janie C. Lee, Houston, by 1980; Bequest from estate of the above to The Menil Collection, Houston, 2024. \n(Source: The Menil Collection, 2025)","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Medium and Dimensions","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_medium_dims"}],"content":"Charcoal on paper, 24 1/2 x 18 1/2 inches","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Materials description","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/materials_description"}],"content":"Charcoal on paper","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"description statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"}],"content":"A white V-shape cuts between two dark gray forms that resemble the sides of a canyon. A small triangle of white appears at the base of the two forms like a river running between them.","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Artist(s)","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_artist"}],"content":"Georgia O'Keeffe","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"credit line","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300026687"}],"content":"The Menil Collection, Houston, Bequest of Janie C. Lee","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Holding Institution","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_instituion"}],"content":"The Menil Collection","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"cr_remarks_1999","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/local/cr_remarks_1999"}],"content":["Not recorded Whitney Archive, Downtown Gallery Archive, Abiquiú Notebooks. See cat. nos. 1499, 1539–54, 1577,2021–24. (Source: Lynes, 1999)"],"type":"LinguisticObject"},{"cla